## Development

This package follows the Campbell lab
[Python development standards](https://github.com/campbio/py-dev-standards).
Everything a contributor — or a coding agent — needs is in `AGENTS.md` and
`dev/standards.md`.

```bash
make sync     # install the package and all development dependencies
make check    # lint, typecheck and test
make help     # list every target
```

Work happens on branches off `devel`, and pull requests target `devel`.
`main` only ever moves at a release.

